course: dictionary
lesson: 9580
title: Strawberry: a fruit with seeds outside
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A strawberry is a small, red, sweet fruit. Its seeds are tiny and sit on the outside of the fruit, not hidden inside like the pips of an apple. Look for the green leaves on top too: they show you where the fruit grows.
explain: Words in a sentence give clues. «A strawberry wears its seeds on the outside» tells you exactly where the seeds are. «Bees pollinate many fruit crops, such as apples and strawberries» tells you that strawberries are a crop, a plant grown to be picked and eaten.
explain: The plant is a different thing from the fruit. A strawberry plant grows low on the ground and sends out runners, long thin stems that reach out and make new plants. When you read about strawberry picking, the word means the fruit you pick, and the plant is where it grows.
fact: A strawberry is a small, red, sweet fruit with tiny seeds on its outside.
fact: The green leaves on top of a strawberry are part of the plant, not the fruit.
fact: A strawberry plant grows low on the ground and sends out runners to make new plants.
fact: «A banana is a berry but a strawberry is not»: a surprise from the kitchen, so always check how a word is used.
fact: Bees and other insects help many crops, such as apples, strawberries and almonds, so without them we would have much less fruit.
exercise: «A strawberry wears its seeds on the outside.» Where are the seeds on a strawberry? | Inside, in the middle | *On the outside | Only at the top | Under the leaves
exercise: «Bees pollinate many fruit crops, such as apples and strawberries.» Which of these is named as a crop in the sentence? | Bananas | Grapes | Oranges | *Strawberries
exercise: What does a strawberry plant do? | It grows tall like a tree | It makes cream | *It grows low on the ground and sends out runners | It swims in ponds
test: Which words describe the fruit: small, red, sweet, with seeds on the outside? | *Strawberry | Peanut | Potato | Pineapple
test: «Strawberries and cream» is a famous treat. What is the main fruit in it? | Apples | Cream | *Strawberries | Almonds
exam: «A strawberry is not a berry, but a banana is.» What is the surprise in this sentence? | Berries are always green | Bananas are small and red | Strawberries grow in the sea | *Some fruits have names that do not match the science
